%402x.png","line":21,"embedded":true},{"title":"Platform considerations","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/sliders#Platform-considerations","line":23},{"title":"iOS, iPadOS","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/sliders#iOS-iPadOS","line":27},{"title":"Playing audio","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/playing-audio","line":29},{"title":"macOS","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/sliders#macOS","line":31},{"title":"An illustration of a horizontal slider with the thumb in the middle. The leading portion of the track up to the thumb is filled with a blue highlight color.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/92445cf683c4dc1b179fb5359a0bdb28/sliders-no-tick-marks%402x.png","line":39,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of a horizontal slider with the thumb between two tick marks in the middle of the slider. The leading portion of the track up to the thumb is filled with a blue highlight color.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/e31ef9e35e8675bd62f695ba6a988a51/sliders-tick-marks%402x.png","line":41,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of a circular slider with the thumb at the 12 o'clock position.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/3f253ed199e7e92b6124e6161dd79152/sliders-circular%402x.png","line":43,"embedded":true},{"title":"Labels","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/labels","line":49},{"title":"sentence-style capitalization","target":"https://help.apple.com/applestyleguide/#/apsgb744e4a3?sub=apdca93e113f1d64","line":49},{"title":"A partial screenshot of the Energy Saver settings pane in macOS, cropped to show the slider that controls how long the display remains on after inactivity.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/90d44ac8355f4a4e672e5e81633814e6/sliders-labels%402x.png","li